{"obsah":"<p>The weekend was 50/50 on whether weather apps work. Luckily they don't, so instead of the promised rain we rode all the booked events in two teams. Vlasta, Michal Budský, Ondřej Nenadál and later Lukáš Valný had the Kunratice Indian Summer and the Škvorec fair on their plate. Martin Šimůnek took Jablonec nad Nisou.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>The Kunratice Indian Summer is a really successful mini-festival for kids and adults with concerts and loads of activities. The beautiful chateau park offered visitors just about everything you could think of at an event like this. In one longer show Vlasta, Michal and Ondra delivered a solid piece of action that entertained everyone present, including the organisers :). Vlasta tested a few setup changes on his new 26” trial bike. Michal Budský has ridden a street bike in recent years and Ondra represented the 20” trial bikes. So basically everything the Trial sport has to offer.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>After the exhibition we moved quickly to Škvorec, where we were invited for the second time to the local festival called the Škvorec fair. Lukáš Valný joined us there and we took up a tactical spot in the middle of the grounds. The local green and park were packed and concerts were under way. Our job was to ride 2 shows. Space was a bit tight, but that wasn't a problem for us. In the second show there was even an interesting tug of war among the local women and girls over who would become the volunteer living obstacle. Honestly, that's probably never happened to us before :)</p>\n\n<p>Martin sent a few photos from the event he rode in Jablonec nad Nisou, and evidently he had a decent crowd at this little corporate event too, as is usual for him. </p>\n\n<p>Jablonec:</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2FJablonec-nad-Nisou3.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2FJablonec-nad-Nisou3.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-212014\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2FJablonec-nad-Nisou1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2FJablonec-nad-Nisou1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-212015\"/></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n<p>Škvorec</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2F39CDE46D-2606-428D-9724-B1390F433B58.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2F39CDE46D-2606-428D-9724-B1390F433B58.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-212024\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2F161CE506-FDA9-42B7-9FB4-C45AB6A64BAE.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2F161CE506-FDA9-42B7-9FB4-C45AB6A64BAE.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-212021\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2FIMG_6943.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2